  "contentPages" : [
"^yellow;Chapter 4: Practical Applications^reset;

Now that you're familiar with the necessary ingredients for a good trap, here are some sample setups that you can adapt to fit your lair.

^green;Bait and Switch:^reset;
Place a visible chest next to a button or switch that opens an obvious door. Wire the switch to a boulder trap that rolls a rock through the door as it opens. Surprise!

^#8888CC;>>",

"^yellow;Chapter 4: Practical Applications^reset;

^green;Burning Oil:^reset;
Place enough oil to hide some landmines. If you add just the right amount, you can hide the trap without smothering the resultant flames!

^green;Spike Trap With Benefits:^reset;
Use trapdoors to drop your victim into a spike pit full of slime with an obvious exit. Mount a flamethrower there for an easy barbecue!

^#8888CC;>>",

"^yellow;Chapter 4: Practical Applications^reset;

^green;Just Add Scorpions:^reset;
Spruce up a pit or hallway with biting, stinging friends! Scorpions are a great way to force your victims away from sure footing and into other traps.

^green;The Reward Is Pain:^reset;
Wire up an elaborate switch puzzle next to a treasure chest that drops visitors into a pit. Make those pesky adventurers earn their suffering!

^#8888CC;>>",

"^yellow;Chapter 4: Practical Applications^reset;

^green;All Grown Up:^reset;
Juvenile monsters are easy to find and capture. They also make great distractions for adventurers while an adult monster closes in on its prey.

^green;Pass the Sand, Please:^reset;
It sounds so simple that it could never work, but sometimes just dumping a lot of sand on intruders will kill them. Consider also buying a shop vacuum.

^#8888CC;>>",

"^yellow;Chapter 4: Practical Applications^reset;

^green;Other Fun Ideas:^reset;
Whether your palace needs defense from bandits or your lair needs an answer to roving treasure hunters, there's always room to get creative with new trap components. Here are a few more ideas to experiment with:
- ^yellow;Poisonous gases^reset;
- ^yellow;Tripwires and explosives^reset;
- ^yellow;Spinning sawblades^reset;
- ^yellow;Laser crystals^reset;
- ^yellow;Mimic chests^reset;
- ^yellow;Baby Shark 10 Hours (4K HD 60FPS)^reset;"

